{"date":"2025-06-20","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_7ce67bddc53f258a3efd13aeb07e81bd","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1750411800,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-06-17","chunk":0,"id":"m_58271a65caf0fc7c6b62e0765bdb202b"}}},{"id":"m_1049aa1608720ba25b893c1a9278829a","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1750411837,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a84dbd2532b24cb53959710adbc8ac3f","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1750411874,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dea0763a7e552d2d83a963864bcb5735","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1750411911,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b8878706579a0331a6b179514f3bd616","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1750411948,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_52c36fcfeb6b15a63fd23c0c790b7175","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1750411985,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3ff9dfa84e85fc9d72b372d7f0b1c9e4","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1750412022,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_e58b947c64f26dc5fed27c2e487718eb","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1750412059,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ab1b76ebb41ab6b61184cd13b70545d4","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1750412096,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_acf7b134ef9ef0b0bef293bdddaaf20d","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1750412133,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_91da58fba6992efa6c43a6ae2de6b006","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1750412170,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_e2e2b6c8c9f5174f1992e491e349fcfe","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1750412207,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_41d285da42f2ed4ff3c0a88b20d20ebc","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1750412244,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6d49d2c8a0061f42850a490e9ecdb6bf","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1750412281,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_210968daeaded1dd6ffe22bbf557ac58","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1750412318,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dea6fb8710497fed1c0268a94094117d","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1750412355,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_535acc019d0a9e2429779a391e40fce4","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1750412392,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d13c0df3f6b23d2a9e7bd8021bcd5d8d","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1750412429,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a0ef1e9e33caa4e7db49555ed9a59d54","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1750412466,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7c1eac35f19bf027070adb5f807fa24f","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1750412503,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_27aa0b592e4e8cf70cd55a514fa7545d","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1750412540,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_53cdb6c98835d53a1cfddf29ccdcc909","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1750412577,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e008ad6fd08f69bc8484504cce076b90","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1750412614,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2b47742d92a93e89d63669bc76df7ac3","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1750412651,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
